《建筑年表》 / A Timeline of Buildings — CREDITS

Picture
  Every frame is drawn in code (Canvas 2D, HTML/JavaScript). No photographs,
  stock footage, plans or video generation.

Buildings
  72 simplified diagrams, each an original code drawing. Names, cities and
  dates identify real buildings; the drawings are not to scale and are not
  reproductions of drawings, models or photographs. Modern buildings remain
  the intellectual property of their architects; no endorsement is implied.

Music and sound
  Original score and foley synthesized from scratch with numpy/scipy in
  audio/score.py. No sample libraries, no existing melodies.

Fonts
  IM Fell English, Fredoka, Lilita One, ZCOOL KuaiLe — SIL Open Font License,
  from the lemo-opuscar core/fonts collection (see fonts/OFL.md).
  Source Han Serif SC, Microsoft YaHei, KaiTi, Georgia, Consolas, Bahnschrift —
  fonts present on the production system; not redistributed.

Facts
  See FACTS.md for the 72 dates and their source links, plus notes on
  contested or start-vs-completion dates.
